## Interface: 16001
## Title: Glowey's |cff5fd38dGear|r
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\GloweyGear\Media\icon.png
## Group: GloweyGear
## Notes: Works on its own, and integrates with Daylight UI when it's installed (its options window, look and profiles). Scores gear for your spec, compares it with what you wear and carry, and lists the best upgrades for sale on the Auction House by improvement per gold. The same verdict shows on item tooltips and bag slots.
